  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRC Operational Costs for Humanitarian Capacity Development Project 2016/17</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 of the  Humanitarian Capacity Development programme (HCD) started in April 2016 involving 3 new partners and 3 existing from the phase 1 in the DRC. Most of them are dioceses structures, 1 national Caritas and 1 non faith organisation. This project is intended to support a number of actions aiming at bringing some or all partners to common learning events such as simulation exercises, training on Core Humanitarian Standards, security updates, meetings with bishops, etc. Self-assessment workshops to establish capacity baseline (and end line) for partners also fall under this project as well as HCD programme visibility.</narrative>
  </description>
